Bind destinations to network interfaces

Usage:
  ifbound [flags]
  ifbound [command]

Available Commands:
  apply       Send a configuration file to ifboundd and print the new status
  completion  Generate the autocompletion script for the specified shell
  help        Help about a command
  version     Print the version of ifbound and of ifboundd

Flags:
  -h, --help      help for ifbound
  -v, --version   version for ifbound

Use "ifbound [command] --help" for more information about a command.
